# Everything here is shell, JS or Markdown consumed on macOS. A CRLF file that
# reaches this repo breaks more than it looks like it should: a `\r` on a blank
# line in fleet.env is a command bash cannot find, and a `\r` at the end of
# FLEET_LABEL_PREFIX=... silently becomes part of the launchd label.
* text=auto eol=lf
